        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Life, Strictly Slots, Casino Gaming\n- People: Horace Bristol, Frank Legato\n- Topics: publication schedules, magazine founding, photography, slot machines, video poker\n\nFacts:\n- Life was published weekly until 1972.\n- Life was published intermittently as a special from 1972 to 1978.\n- Life was published monthly from 1978 to 2000.\n- Strictly Slots was founded in 1998.\n- Strictly Slots is a monthly magazine aimed at slot machine and video poker players.\n- Horace Bristol was a twentieth-century American photographer best known for his work in Life.\n- Frank Legato founded and edited Casino Gaming magazine.\n- Frank Legato wrote a monthly humorous column about slot machines for Strictly Slots magazine.",
